			"notes": "## BREAKING CHANGES\n- Merge class `MobEffectIcon` into `ClientUtil`.\n  - Move method `MobEffectIcon::render` to `ClientUtil::renderEffectIcon`.\n  - Move field `MobEffectIcon::ICONS` to `ClientUtil::EFFECT_ICONS`.\n- Remove following methods:\n  - `DMCapabilities::hasCapability`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::setArmor`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::setChest`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::setSaddle`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::getArmor`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::getChest`\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::getSaddle`\n\n## Fix\n- Dragons with small bounding box can detect ground correctly."
