			"notes": "## BREAKING CHANGES\n- Remove class `LinearInterpolation`.\n- Replace class `LinearInterpolation.Clamped` with `InterpolatedFloat`.\n- Remove field `DragonAnimator::animTimer`.\n- Rename field `DragonAnimator::FlutterTimer` to `DragonAnimator::flutterTimer`.\n- Remove method `DragonMounts::getMetadata`.\n\n## Change\n- Reduce the particles that dragons spawn.\n\n## Fixes\n- Moonlight dragon and sunlight dragon can spawn particles correctly.\n- Keep the flutter direction facing downward when hovering."
