			"notes": "## BREAKING CHANGES\n- Replace classes `NeckPart` and `TailPart` with interface `ISegmentedPart`.\n- Replace classes `NeckPart` and `HornedTailPart` with class `ComplexSegmentedPart`.\n- Replace class `SimpleTailPart` with class `SimpleSegmentedPart`.\n- Constructor of `ScalablePart.Snapshot` takes parameters now.\n- Remove method `ScalablePart.Snapshot::saveScalable`.\n- Remove following fields:\n  - `Segment::scaleX`\n  - `Segment::scaleY`\n  - `Segment::scaleZ`\n  - `DragonArmorItem::TEXTURE_PREFIX`\n- Add abstract method `VariantAppearance::getArmorTexture`.\n- Replace field `DragonArmorItem::texture` with `DragonArmorItem::material`.\n- Rename interface `ITextureOffsetDefiner` to `IUVRegistry`.\n\n## Additions\n- Add Breeze dragon variant, which belongs to Aether dragon type.\n- Add Enchanting Table dragon variant, which belongs to Enchanted dragon type.\n- Add Eclipse dragon variant, which belongs to Moonlight dragon type.\n- Add Stray dragon variant, which belongs to Skeleton dragon type.\n- Add Bogged dragon variant, which belongs to Skeleton dragon type.\n- Add Aurora dragon variant, which belongs to Sunlight dragon type.\n- Add Crystal dragon variant, which belongs to Terra dragon type.\n- Add Brine dragon variant, which belongs to Water dragon type.\n\n## Changes\n- Replace Rare Fire dragon variant with Blue Fire dragon variant .\n- Replace Rare Storm dragon variant with Bronzed Storm dragon variant.\n- Update textures for Rare Ender dragons.\n- Update textures for dragons in following types:\n  - Aether\n  - Dark\n  - Enchanted\n  - Fire\n  - Moonlight\n  - Skeleton\n  - Storm\n  - Sunlight\n  - Terra\n  - Water\n  - Wither\n- Update textures for dragon armors.\n- Update model for skeleton dragons.\n- Update model for water dragons.\n\n## Fix\n- Shatter sound will be played only when an egg hatches or dies."
		},
