			"notes": "## BREAKING CHANGES\n- Remove following fields:\n  - `TameableDragonEntity::lifeStageHelper`\n  - `DragonLifeStage::durationTicks`\n  - `DragonLifeStage::boundaryTick`\n- Remove following methods:\n  - `DragonLifeStage::getLifeStageFromTickCount`\n  - `DragonLifeStage::getStageProgressFromTickCount`\n  - `DragonLifeStage::getScaleFromTickCount`\n  - `DragonLifeStage::clipTickCountToValid`\n- Remove following classes:\n  - `ClientServerSynchronisedTickCount`\n  - `DragonLifeStageHelper`\n- Rename `DragonType::DATA_PARAMETER_KEY` to `DragonType::SERIALIZATION_KEY`.\n- Rename `DragonVariant::DATA_PARAMETER_KEY` to `DragonVariant::SERIALIZATION_KEY`.\n- Attribute modifiers applied by dragon type won't be president by default.\n\n## Addition\n- Add following configurations on server side:\n  - `minIncubationDuration`\n  - `hatchlingStageDuration`\n  - `infantStageDuration`\n  - `fledglingStageDuration`\n  - `juvenileStageDuration`\n\n## Changes\n- The actual incubation duration is random now.\n  - Each wobble has a 50% chance to finish hatching after minimum incubation duration.\n    - It will delay the hatching time for about 640 ticks in average.\n  - Reduce default minimum incubation duration from 30 minutes to 20 minutes.\n- Increase wobble rotation axes of dragon egg from 8 to 360.\n- Younger dragons follow their owners more closely.\n- Enhanced command `/dragonmounts free <targets>` to `/dragonmounts free <targets> [(forced|owned_by <owner>)]`.\n\n## Fixes\n- Dragons won't keep aging when the growth is paused on client side.\n- Attribute modifiers can be applied by dragon type on client side.\n- Debug overlay will be rendered once a frame."
